uate Studies Workforce Development Schools & Programs Connected Learning Academic Catalog & Calendar Academic Centers Academic Support Lasell Insights Study Abroad Registrar Campus Life Activities & Involvement Housing & Residential Life Health and Wellness Dining Student Support Career Center Online Bookstore & Gear Shop Connected Start Fall Move-in and Orientation Athletics LaserPride - Official site of Lasell Athletics Varsity Sports Recruits Lasers & Boomer Athletic Facilities Recreation and Intramurals Alumni Alumni News Alumni Events Ways to Give Leaves Graduate Studies Find Your Program Academics Tuition & Aid Admissions Lasell Approach Parents & Families myLasell Interactive Map Search Submit search Undergraduate Deposit Admissions › Undergraduate Admission › Accepted Students › Undergraduate Deposit Submit Your Enrollment Deposit Today We are now accepting enrollment deposits for the Fall 2026 and Spring 2027 terms. If you have questions or need assistance, contact your enrollment counselor or reach us at info@lasell.edu or 617-243-2225. Questions? Contact Us! Three ways to make your deposit: 1. Log into the Applicant Portal 2. Using your Applicant ID, deposit through our online payment system . (Your Applicant ID can be found on the bottom left corner of your acceptance letter.) 3. Mail a check. The resident student deposit total is $450 ($400 tuition deposit and $50 orientation) and the commuter student deposit total is $250 (tuition deposit and orientation fee). Please make sure the check is made out to Lasell University and that the name of the enrolling student is clearly indicated. We will send you a confirmation and a link to the New Student Welcome website once we receive your deposit. Have questions or need assistance submitting your deposit online? We're here to help, so please reach out to us at the Office of Undergraduate Admission by phone at 617-243-2225 or by email at info@lasell.edu . Again, welcome to the Lasell University community! We're 